  speakerName: TOMAS
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Sometimes you need to call someone toward you.


    In Ilokano,
    ''umay ditoy'' means ''come here.''


    Use it when asking someone to move
    toward your location.


    Listen carefully: umay ditoy.


    Now, try saying
    ''umay ditoy'' yourself.'
